ose\"><form method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"1.1\" name=\"dismissSiteNotice\">[<button type=\"submit\"><a role=\"button\">dismiss</a></button>]</form></div><div class=\"mw-dismissable-notice-body\"><div id=\"localNotice\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><div class=\"sitenotice\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Welcome to <a href=\"/\" title=\"DayRWiki\">Day R Survival</a> Wiki!\nWe are still developing pages information regarding major update v.815. You can help us enriching pages <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Stub_article\" title=\"Category:Stub article\">here</a>!\n</p></div></div></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mw-indicators\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"mw-indicator-mw-helplink\" class=\"mw-indicator\"><a href=\"https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Help:Categories\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"mw-helplink\"><span class=\"mw-helplink-icon\"></span>Help</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<h1 id=\"firstHeading\" class=\"firstHeading mw-first-heading\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-namespace\">Category</span><span class=\"mw-page-title-separator\">:</span><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Constructions</span></h1>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bodyContent\" class=\"vector-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"siteSub\" class=\"noprint\">From Day R Wiki</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"contentSub\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"contentSub2\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"jump-to-nav\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"mw-jump-link\" href=\"#mw-head\">Jump to navigation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"mw-jump-link\" href=\"#searchInput\">Jump to search</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"mw-content-text\" class=\"mw-body-content\"><div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>__NOCATEGORYGALLERY__\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Introduction\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Introduction</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Constructions_list\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Constructions list</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Perks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Perks</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Weather</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introduction\"><b>Introduction</b></span></h2>\n<p>Constructions are Items that can be built but can not be moved but can be deconstruct.\n</p><p>Most are first marked and then built over time. Some require being constructed 10 to 100 times using different kind of tools, such as shovels, axes, tool kits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Constructions_list\"><b>Constructions list</b></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Constructions for production\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Barrel\" title=\"Barrel\">Barrel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Brick_oven\" title=\"Brick oven\">Brick oven</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chemistry_lab\" title=\"Chemistry lab\">Chemistry lab</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Draw_well\" title=\"Draw well\">Draw well</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Drying_rack\" title=\"Drying rack\">Drying rack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Forge_chimney\" title=\"Forge chimney\">Forge chimney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Greenhouse\" title=\"Greenhouse\">Greenhouse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rice_Field\" title=\"Rice Field\">Rice Field</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Steelmaking_furnace\" title=\"Steelmaking furnace\">Steelmaking furnace</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_purifier\" title=\"Water purifier\">Water purifier</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Workbench\" title=\"Workbench\">Workbench</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Constructions for shelter\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_house\" title=\"Abandoned house\">Abandoned house</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Brick_house\" title=\"Brick house\">Brick house</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cellar\" title=\"Cellar\">Cellar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dugout\" title=\"Dugout\">Dugout</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hut\" title=\"Hut\">Hut</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Moroz%27s_Terem\" title=\"Moroz's Terem\">Moroz's Terem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tent_(Pitched)\" title=\"Tent (Pitched)\">Tent (Pitched)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_house\" title=\"Wooden house\">Wooden house</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Perks\"><b>Perks</b></span></h2>\n<p>Constructions benefit from these <a href=\"/wiki/Perks\" title=\"Perks\">Perks</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Farmer?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Farmer (page does not exist)\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Greenhouse\" title=\"Greenhouse\">Greenhouse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rice_Field\" title=\"Rice Field\">Rice Field</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weather\"><b>Weather</b></span></h2>\n<p>Constructions benefit from these <a href=\"/wiki/Weather\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weather\">Weather</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Barren Season\n<ul><li>Greenhouse</li></ul></li>\n<li>Harvest Season\n<ul><li>Greenhouse</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>Constructions benefit from these special weather event:\n</p><p>1. Halloween 2020\n</p>\n<ul><li>Pumpkin harvest\n<ul><li>Greenhouse</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>2. Christmas &amp; New year 2021\n</p>\n<ul><li>Mandarin\n<ul><li>Greenhouse</li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260725133138\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 